            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "128. An employee promoted from a Maintenance, Service or Technical classification to another Maintenance, Service, Technical or Clerical classification shall be paid the first step rate of the new classification which is next above his/her former rate and which will provide an increase of at least $0.15 per hour except that in no case will an employee be eligible for a rate in excess of the maximum of his/her new classification. In addition to this",
